{
  "book": "1nephi",
  "bookName": "1 Nephi",
  "chapter": 1,
  "voice": {
    "provider": "elevenlabs",
    "voice_id": "ddDFRErfhdc2asyySOG5",
    "model_id": "eleven_multilingual_v2",
    "settings": {
      "stability": 0.5,
      "similarity_boost": 0.75,
      "style": 0.35,
      "use_speaker_boost": true
    },
    "name": "Samuel"
  },
  "pauses": {
    "line_ms": 180,
    "verse_ms": 500
  },
  "duration": 333.108,
  "lines": [
    {
      "start": 0.0,
      "end": 3.065,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "I, Nephi, having been born of goodly parents,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 1
    },
    {
      "start": 3.245,
      "end": 6.728,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I was taught somewhat in all the learning of my father;",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 2
    },
    {
      "start": 6.908,
      "end": 10.577,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and having seen many afflictions in the course of my days,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 3
    },
    {
      "start": 10.757,
      "end": 15.401,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "nevertheless, having been highly favored of the Lord in all my days;",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 4
    },
    {
      "start": 15.581,
      "end": 20.55,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, having had a great knowledge of the goodness and the mysteries of God,",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 5
    },
    {
      "start": 20.73,
      "end": 24.12,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "therefore I make a record of my proceedings in my days.",
      "verse": "1:1",
      "lineIndex": 6
    },
    {
      "start": 24.8,
      "end": 27.911,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, I make a record in the language of my father,",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 7
    },
    {
      "start": 28.091,
      "end": 31.156,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which consists of the learning of the Jews",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 8
    },
    {
      "start": 31.336,
      "end": 33.565,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the language of the Egyptians.",
      "verse": "1:2",
      "lineIndex": 9
    },
    {
      "start": 34.245,
      "end": 37.217,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And I know that the record which I make is true;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 10
    },
    {
      "start": 37.397,
      "end": 39.533,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I make it with mine own hand;",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 11
    },
    {
      "start": 39.713,
      "end": 41.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and I make it according to my knowledge.",
      "verse": "1:3",
      "lineIndex": 12
    },
    {
      "start": 42.436,
      "end": 49.588,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "For it came to pass in the commencement of the first year of the reign of Zedekiah, king of Judah,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 14
    },
    {
      "start": 49.768,
      "end": 53.948,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "(my father, Lehi, having dwelt at Jerusalem in all his days);",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 15
    },
    {
      "start": 54.128,
      "end": 56.914,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and in that same year there came many prophets,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 16
    },
    {
      "start": 57.094,
      "end": 60.438,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "prophesying unto the people that they must repent,",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 17
    },
    {
      "start": 60.618,
      "end": 63.59,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "or the great city Jerusalem must be destroyed.",
      "verse": "1:4",
      "lineIndex": 18
    },
    {
      "start": 64.27,
      "end": 75.741,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wherefore it came to pass that my father, Lehi, as he went forth prayed unto the Lord, yea, even with all his heart, in behalf of his people.",
      "verse": "1:5",
      "lineIndex": 20
    },
    {
      "start": 76.421,
      "end": 79.393,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass as he prayed unto the Lord,",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 21
    },
    {
      "start": 79.573,
      "end": 81.523,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "there came a pillar of fire",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 22
    },
    {
      "start": 81.703,
      "end": 84.025,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and dwelt upon a rock before him;",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 23
    },
    {
      "start": 84.205,
      "end": 86.063,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he saw and heard much;",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 24
    },
    {
      "start": 86.243,
      "end": 89.494,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and because of the things which he saw and heard",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 25
    },
    {
      "start": 89.674,
      "end": 91.95,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he did quake and tremble exceedingly.",
      "verse": "1:6",
      "lineIndex": 26
    },
    {
      "start": 92.63,
      "end": 97.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he returned to his own house at Jerusalem;",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 27
    },
    {
      "start": 97.547,
      "end": 99.637,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he cast himself upon his bed,",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 28
    },
    {
      "start": 99.817,
      "end": 101.907,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "being overcome with the Spirit",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 29
    },
    {
      "start": 102.087,
      "end": 103.945,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the things which he had seen.",
      "verse": "1:7",
      "lineIndex": 30
    },
    {
      "start": 104.625,
      "end": 106.854,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And being thus overcome with the Spirit,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 31
    },
    {
      "start": 107.034,
      "end": 109.356,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was carried away in a vision,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 32
    },
    {
      "start": 109.536,
      "end": 111.719,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "even that he saw the heavens open",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 33
    },
    {
      "start": 111.899,
      "end": 115.103,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he thought he saw God sitting upon his throne,",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 34
    },
    {
      "start": 115.283,
      "end": 121.367,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "surrounded with numberless concourses of angels in the attitude of singing and praising their God.",
      "verse": "1:8",
      "lineIndex": 35
    },
    {
      "start": 122.047,
      "end": 124.369,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that he saw One",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 36
    },
    {
      "start": 124.549,
      "end": 127.382,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "descending out of the midst of heaven,",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 37
    },
    {
      "start": 127.562,
      "end": 132.763,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he beheld that his luster was above that of the sun at noon-day.",
      "verse": "1:9",
      "lineIndex": 38
    },
    {
      "start": 133.443,
      "end": 136.229,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he also saw twelve others following him,",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 39
    },
    {
      "start": 136.409,
      "end": 141.703,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and their brightness did exceed that of the stars in the firmament.",
      "verse": "1:10",
      "lineIndex": 40
    },
    {
      "start": 142.383,
      "end": 144.148,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And they came down",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 41
    },
    {
      "start": 144.328,
      "end": 146.696,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and went forth upon the face of the earth;",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 42
    },
    {
      "start": 146.876,
      "end": 148.362,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the first came",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 43
    },
    {
      "start": 148.542,
      "end": 150.353,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stood before my father,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 44
    },
    {
      "start": 150.533,
      "end": 152.205,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and gave unto him a book,",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 45
    },
    {
      "start": 152.385,
      "end": 154.335,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and bade him that he should read.",
      "verse": "1:11",
      "lineIndex": 46
    },
    {
      "start": 155.015,
      "end": 157.244,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that as he read,",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 47
    },
    {
      "start": 157.424,
      "end": 159.746,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he was filled with the Spirit of the Lord.",
      "verse": "1:12",
      "lineIndex": 48
    },
    {
      "start": 160.426,
      "end": 162.284,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And he read, saying:",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 49
    },
    {
      "start": 162.464,
      "end": 164.414,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Wo, wo, unto Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 50
    },
    {
      "start": 164.594,
      "end": 167.288,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for I have seen thine abominations!",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 51
    },
    {
      "start": 167.468,
      "end": 170.765,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Yea, and many things did my father read concerning Jerusalem\u2014",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 52
    },
    {
      "start": 170.945,
      "end": 172.756,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that it should be destroyed,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 53
    },
    {
      "start": 172.936,
      "end": 174.933,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and the inhabitants thereof;",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 54
    },
    {
      "start": 175.113,
      "end": 177.389,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "many should perish by the sword,",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 55
    },
    {
      "start": 177.569,
      "end": 180.727,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and many should be carried away captive into Babylon.",
      "verse": "1:13",
      "lineIndex": 56
    },
    {
      "start": 181.407,
      "end": 187.026,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that when my father had read and seen many great and marvelous things,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 57
    },
    {
      "start": 187.206,
      "end": 190.41,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "he did exclaim many things unto the Lord; such as:",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 58
    },
    {
      "start": 190.59,
      "end": 193.005,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Great and marvelous are thy works,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 59
    },
    {
      "start": 193.185,
      "end": 194.857,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "O Lord God Almighty!",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 60
    },
    {
      "start": 195.037,
      "end": 197.313,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Thy throne is high in the heavens,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 61
    },
    {
      "start": 197.493,
      "end": 200.279,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and thy power, and goodness, and mercy",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 62
    },
    {
      "start": 200.459,
      "end": 203.338,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "are over all the inhabitants of the earth;",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 63
    },
    {
      "start": 203.518,
      "end": 205.794,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and, because thou art merciful,",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 64
    },
    {
      "start": 205.974,
      "end": 209.829,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "thou wilt not suffer those who come unto thee that they shall perish!",
      "verse": "1:14",
      "lineIndex": 65
    },
    {
      "start": 210.509,
      "end": 215.246,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And after this manner was the language of my father in the praising of his God;",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 66
    },
    {
      "start": 215.426,
      "end": 217.144,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for his soul did rejoice,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 67
    },
    {
      "start": 217.324,
      "end": 220.993,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and his whole heart was filled, because of the things which he had seen,",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 68
    },
    {
      "start": 221.173,
      "end": 223.402,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, which the Lord had shown unto him.",
      "verse": "1:15",
      "lineIndex": 69
    },
    {
      "start": 224.082,
      "end": 227.054,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And now I, Nephi, do not make a full account",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 70
    },
    {
      "start": 227.234,
      "end": 229.788,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of the things which my father hath written,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 71
    },
    {
      "start": 229.968,
      "end": 232.29,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he hath written many things",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 72
    },
    {
      "start": 232.47,
      "end": 234.978,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he saw in visions and in dreams;",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 73
    },
    {
      "start": 235.158,
      "end": 237.712,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he also hath written many things",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 74
    },
    {
      "start": 237.892,
      "end": 241.421,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "which he prophesied and spake unto his children,",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 75
    },
    {
      "start": 241.601,
      "end": 243.737,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "of which I shall not make a full account.",
      "verse": "1:16",
      "lineIndex": 76
    },
    {
      "start": 244.417,
      "end": 247.575,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But I shall make an account of my proceedings in my days.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 77
    },
    {
      "start": 247.755,
      "end": 251.192,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Behold, I make a abridgment of the record of my father,",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 78
    },
    {
      "start": 251.372,
      "end": 254.483,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "upon plates which I have made with mine own hands;",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 79
    },
    {
      "start": 254.663,
      "end": 258.332,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "wherefore, after I have abridged the record of my father",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 80
    },
    {
      "start": 258.512,
      "end": 261.066,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "then will I make an account of mine own life.",
      "verse": "1:17",
      "lineIndex": 81
    },
    {
      "start": 261.746,
      "end": 268.851,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "Therefore, I would that ye should know that after the Lord had shown so many marvelous things unto my father, Lehi,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 83
    },
    {
      "start": 269.031,
      "end": 271.91,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "yea, concerning the destruction of Jerusalem,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 84
    },
    {
      "start": 272.09,
      "end": 274.458,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "behold he went forth among the people,",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 85
    },
    {
      "start": 274.638,
      "end": 276.449,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and began to prophesy",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 86
    },
    {
      "start": 276.629,
      "end": 281.087,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and to declare unto them concerning the things which he had both seen and heard.",
      "verse": "1:18",
      "lineIndex": 87
    },
    {
      "start": 281.767,
      "end": 288.222,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And it came to pass that the Jews did mock him because of the things which he testified of them;",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 88
    },
    {
      "start": 288.402,
      "end": 292.442,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "for he truly testified of their wickedness and their abominations;",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 89
    },
    {
      "start": 292.622,
      "end": 295.919,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and he testified that the things which he saw and heard,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 90
    },
    {
      "start": 296.099,
      "end": 298.467,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the things which he read in the book,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 91
    },
    {
      "start": 298.647,
      "end": 301.944,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "manifested plainly of the coming of a Messiah,",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 92
    },
    {
      "start": 302.124,
      "end": 304.307,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and also the redemption of the world.",
      "verse": "1:19",
      "lineIndex": 93
    },
    {
      "start": 304.987,
      "end": 311.21,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "And when the Jews heard these things they were angry with him; yea, even as with the prophets of old,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 94
    },
    {
      "start": 311.39,
      "end": 313.155,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "whom they had cast out,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 95
    },
    {
      "start": 313.335,
      "end": 315.193,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and stoned, and slain;",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 96
    },
    {
      "start": 315.373,
      "end": 317.277,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "and they also sought his life,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 97
    },
    {
      "start": 317.457,
      "end": 319.407,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that they might take it away.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 98
    },
    {
      "start": 319.587,
      "end": 322.42,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "But behold, I, Nephi, will show unto you",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 99
    },
    {
      "start": 322.6,
      "end": 329.055,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "that the tender mercies of the Lord are over all those whom he hath chosen, because of their faith,",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 100
    },
    {
      "start": 329.235,
      "end": 332.439,
      "type": "line",
      "text": "to make them mighty even unto the power of deliverance.",
      "verse": "1:20",
      "lineIndex": 101
    }
  ]
}